---

OpenBattlefield2 is a clean-room reimplementation of an engine. It contains no
code from the original game and ships no game assets: it reads the data files
of a copy of Battlefield 2 that the user already owns.

Third-party components bundled in third_party/ keep their own licenses:
  * miniz     — MIT
  * stb_image — public domain / MIT
